      "statement": "Repository evidence resources use the repo://path#Lx-Ly URI scheme; the RepositoryEvidenceResolver resolves these against the working tree, enforcing path containment and .openwikiignore boundaries, and carries relocation metadata in the opaque version token so a line range that shifted can be relocated rather than treated as stale.",
